erson_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","title":"老上單于","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"accession","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p018","quote":"後頃之，冒頓死，子稽粥立，號曰老上單于。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-042:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p018","start":15,"end":19,"surface":"老上單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m018-0015","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"accession","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p018","quote":"子稽粥立，號曰老上單于"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存本段用稱與明示繼位，年月未知；公主不推漢帝親生女，宦者保留身分用稱，不改作有授任時日的官職。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","title":"單于","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","quote":"老上稽粥單于初立，孝文皇帝復遣宗室女公主爲單于閼氏，使宦者燕人中行說傅公主。說不欲行，漢彊使之。說曰：「必我行也，爲漢患者。」中行說既至，因降單于，單于甚親幸之。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p020","quote":"初，匈奴好漢繒絮食物，中行說曰：「匈奴人眾不能當漢之一郡，然所以彊者，以衣食異，無仰於漢也。今單于變俗好漢物，漢物不過什二，則匈奴盡歸於漢矣。其得漢繒絮，以馳草棘中，衣袴皆裂敝，以示不如旃裘之完善也。得漢食物皆去之，以示不如湩酪之便美也。」於是說教單于左右疏記，以計課其人眾畜物。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","quote":"漢遺單于書，牘以尺一寸，辭曰「皇帝敬問匈奴大單于無恙」，所遺物及言語云云。中行說令單于遺漢書以尺二寸牘，及印封皆令廣大長，倨傲其辭曰「天地所生日月所置匈奴大單于敬問漢皇帝無恙」，所以遺物言語亦云云。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p023","quote":"自是之後，漢使欲辯論者，中行說輒曰：「漢使無多言，顧漢所輸匈奴繒絮米糱，令其量中，必善美而己矣，何以爲言乎？且所給備善則已；不備，苦惡，則候秋孰，以騎馳蹂而稼穡耳。」日夜教單于候利害處。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m019-0000","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a002","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m019-0021","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a003","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m019-0071","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a004","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m019-0074","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a005","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p020","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0047","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a006","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p020","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0124","usage":"retrospective"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a007","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0002","usage":"narrative"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a008","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0041","usage":"narrative"},{"id":"th-shiji110-043:a009","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p023","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m023-0086","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存本段用稱與明示繼位，年月未知；公主不推漢帝親生女，宦者保留身分用稱，不改作有授任時日的官職。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji110-047","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","title":"大單于","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","quote":"漢遺單于書，牘以尺一寸，辭曰「皇帝敬問匈奴大單于無恙」，所遺物及言語云云。中行說令單于遺漢書以尺二寸牘，及印封皆令廣大長，倨傲其辭曰「天地所生日月所置匈奴大單于敬問漢皇帝無恙」，所以遺物言語亦云云。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-047:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"大單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0019","usage":"narrative"},{"id":"th-shiji110-047:a002","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"大單于","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0067","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"書式中的稱號按前段文帝與老上單于敘事暫接，不以通例推精確書信日期、授任或完整任期；完整公式保留於人物提及。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p018","text":"後頃之，冒頓死，子稽粥立，號曰老上單于。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wop_txs_2xf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m018-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"稽粥","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m018-0015","start":15,"end":19,"surface":"老上單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p019","text":"老上稽粥單于初立，孝文皇帝復遣宗室女公主爲單于閼氏，使宦者燕人中行說傅公主。說不欲行，漢彊使之。說曰：「必我行也，爲漢患者。」中行說既至，因降單于，單于甚親幸之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m019-0000","start":0,"end":6,"surface":"老上稽粥單于","kind":"per