10-xiongnu:p020","text":"初，匈奴好漢繒絮食物，中行說曰：「匈奴人眾不能當漢之一郡，然所以彊者，以衣食異，無仰於漢也。今單于變俗好漢物，漢物不過什二，則匈奴盡歸於漢矣。其得漢繒絮，以馳草棘中，衣袴皆裂敝，以示不如旃裘之完善也。得漢食物皆去之，以示不如湩酪之便美也。」於是說教單于左右疏記，以計課其人眾畜物。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"中行說","kind":"person","person_id":"e8g_59i_f6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"說","kind":"person","person_id":"e8g_59i_f6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p021","text":"漢遺單于書，牘以尺一寸，辭曰「皇帝敬問匈奴大單于無恙」，所遺物及言語云云。中行說令單于遺漢書以尺二寸牘，及印封皆令廣大長，倨傲其辭曰「天地所生日月所置匈奴大單于敬問漢皇帝無恙」，所以遺物言語亦云云。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4zc_ipl_5yk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0019","start":19,"end":24,"surface":"匈奴大單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"中行說","kind":"person","person_id":"e8g_59i_f6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m021-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"單于","kind":